meta {
  name: Get Report by ID
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/daily-reports/{{dailyReportId}}
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

script:post-response {
  if (res.status === 200) {
    const r = res.body.report;
    console.log(`✅ #${r.id} ${r.owner?.name} · ${r.reportDate} · ${r.status} · ${r.entries.length} task(s) · effectiveness ${r.rating ?? "-"}/10`);
  } else {
    console.log("❌", res.status, res.body.error);
  }
}

docs {
  # Get Report by ID

  One report with all tasks — view only. `{{dailyReportId}}` is set by the Save / Submit
  requests, Get My Report and Team - Employee Summary.

  ## Who can open it
  - The employee's **HOD**, **SuperUser**, **Admin** — any date.
  - The owner — **today's report only**. Their own past report returns `403`
    ("Past reports are not available. You can only see and edit today's report.").
  - Anyone else (RM, Management, another HOD, …) — `403 Access denied.`

  ## Response
  ```json
  {
    "report": {
      "id": 42, "empId": "GC-1001", "reportDate": "2026-11-23", "mode": "half", "status": "Submitted",
      "blockers": "Waiting for VPN access", "rating": 8, "isLate": false, "dayClosed": false,
      "submittedAt": "2026-11-23T12:40:00.000Z",
      "entries": [ { "id": 101, "slot": "FIRST_HALF", "title": "Code review", "description": null }, { "id": 102, "slot": "SECOND_HALF", "title": "Fixed the login bug", "description": "PR #12" } ],
      "owner": { "empId": "GC-1001", "name": "Esha Employee", "dept": "Software", "designation": "Developer" }
    }
  }
  ```
  Older reports may have `status` `"Approved"` or `"Returned"` from the retired review
  step — treat both as submitted.
}
